   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Tuesday Night's Squad**: back after 42 archived shows (567 days) [4]\n- **Jesus**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **soulive2006-06-02.mk41.flac16** (recommended): source not stated; 9 songs; 84 min; rated 3.5/5 by 2 [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- DJ Williams played guitar at this show in place of Soulive's regular guitarist, which this listener regretted [2]\n- The show was free at Starr Hill, with DJ Williams on guitar, which the listener found hard to believe beforehand [3]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **soulive2006-06-02.mk41.flac16**: taped by Todd (titotito at gmail); transferred by Todd (titotito at gmail); source: mk41 > kc5 > cmc6 > m248 > mme > d8 (48k) [1]",
